    "The host exposed the model family as gpt-image-2 but not an exact model snapshot or reproducible generation seed.",
    "The finding is specific to one refined-interior portrait prompt with an 85mm portrait perspective; replication on richer editorial, environmental, product, artifact, and transfer-benchmark prompts is required."
